          "text": "Kepha ngiyanincenga, bazalwane, ngenxa yeNkosi uJesu Kristu, nangenxa yothando lukaMoya, ukuba nikhuthale kanye nami emikhulekweni yenu kuNkulunkulu ngenxa yami;",
